>Every further one has 0 rows: a report needs one wide query; the filter in the report separates the topics.</Value><Style><FontFamily>=Code.Schrift(0)</FontFamily><FontSize>8.5pt</FontSize><Color>#062246</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns><Style></Style></Paragraph></Paragraphs><Top>0.0cm</Top><Left>1.5cm</Left><Height>1.2cm</Height><Width>16.2cm</Width><Style><VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign><PaddingLeft>0pt</PaddingLeft><PaddingRight>0pt</PaddingRight><PaddingTop>0pt</PaddingTop><PaddingBottom>0pt</PaddingBottom></Style></Textbox><Textbox Name="S9_G1_n"><CanGrow>false</CanGrow><KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether><Paragraphs><Paragraph><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>2</Value><Style><FontFamily>=Code.Schrift(3)</FontFamily><FontSize>24pt</FontSize><Color>#0F54AC</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns><Style></Style></Paragraph></Paragraphs><Top>1.2cm</Top><Left>0.3cm</Left><Height>1.2cm</Height><Width>1.0cm</Width><Style><VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign><PaddingLeft>0pt</PaddingLeft><PaddingRight>0pt</PaddingRight><PaddingTop>0pt</PaddingTop><PaddingBottom>0pt</PaddingBottom></Style></Textbox><Textbox Name="S9_G1_t"><CanGrow>false</CanGrow><KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether><Paragraphs><Paragraph><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>Only one image type from the model per report.</Value><Style><FontFamily>=Code.Schrift(2)</FontFamily><FontSize>10pt</FontSize><Color>#062246</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns><Style></Style></Paragraph><Paragraph><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>The first image column determines all images; the exception is a sub-table with its own image field.</Value><Style><FontFamily>=Code.Schrift(0)</FontFamily><FontSize>8.5pt</FontSize><Color>#062246</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns><Style></Style></Paragraph></Paragraphs><Top>1.2cm</Top><Left>1.5cm</Left><Height>1.2cm</Height><Width>16.2cm</Width><Style><VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign><PaddingLeft>0pt</PaddingLeft><PaddingRight>0pt</PaddingRight><PaddingTop>0pt</PaddingTop><PaddingBottom>0pt</PaddingBottom><